  "narrative": [
    {
      "text": "A forest plot of percentage agreement between TBST and TST in children without active TB, by test pair: DST AI vs TST 5mm 39.21% (seven studies ranging from 6.25% to 85.71%), DST 5mm vs TST 5mm 76.74% and C-Tb vs TST 15mm 90.37%. The overall random-effects pooled agreement is 56.73% (30.85–79.40) across 2202 participants.",
      "lang": "en",
      "state": "draft",
      "drafted_by": {
        "kind": "agent",
        "id": "claude-code",
        "model": "not-disclosed",
        "session": "https://claude.ai/code/session_01Qmmkt7LJVddPRBy6F6BnEb"
      },
      "drafted_at": "2026-11-11"
    },
    {
      "text": "مخطط شجري لنسبة التوافق بين اختبارات TBST وTST لدى الأطفال غير المصابين بالسل النشط، حسب زوج الاختبارات: DST AI مقابل TST 5 مم 39.21% (سبع دراسات تتراوح بين 6.25% و85.71%)، وDST 5 مم مقابل TST 5 مم 76.74%، وC-Tb مقابل TST 15 مم 90.37%. ويبلغ التوافق المجمّع الإجمالي 56.73% (30.85–79.40) لدى 2202 مشارك.",
      "lang": "ar",
      "state": "draft",
      "drafted_by": {
